        "text": "Iran possessed 102 kilograms of enriched uranium when Trump took office.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Iran currently has 2.5 tons of enriched uranium.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Iran’s current level of enriched uranium is 25 times higher than under Trump.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Trump's maximum pressure campaign has failed to prevent Iran from increasing its enrichment.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Iran is accelerating efforts toward building a nuclear bomb.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Reducing sanctions temporarily could allow diplomacy without permanent concessions.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
