        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The opposing party (Republicans) has significant influence over whether endless wars end.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The phrase 'best friends' refers metaphorically to those most supportive or aligned with ending endless wars.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Endless wars are currently ongoing and widely perceived as problematic by at least some members of Congress.",
