      },
      {
        "text": "The failure to convict in the Senate reflects a broader unwillingness among Republicans to confront uncomfortable truths about their own party’s role.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Public discourse should value truthful recognition of historical events like January 6th as a baseline for democratic integrity.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes Republican reluctance to discuss January 6th undermines democratic accountability.",
